        "fit": "card",
        "label": "Katy Perry",
        "credit": "Public domain, via Wikimedia Commons"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "She thought they were going to see some art.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "eternity",
        "stone": "emerald",
        "metal": "yellow",
        "label": "Off to see art",
        "stones": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Instead, they pulled up to a helicopter.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "real",
        "src": "490-katy-perry-s-proposal-tore-a-pocket-1.jpg",
        "fit": "card",
        "label": "A Los Angeles helicopter",
        "credit": "Public domain, via Wikimedia Commons"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "In the air, he handed her a note to distract her.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "ring",
        "stone": "pink",
        "metal": "yellow",
        "label": "A distracting note",
        "cut": "cushion"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The ring box was too big for his coat pocket.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "necklace",
        "stone": "emerald",
        "metal": "yellow",
        "label": "A big box",
        "cut": "emerald"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He tugged so hard that the pocket ripped.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "earrings",
        "stone": "morganite",
        "metal": "yellow",
        "label": "A torn pocket",
        "cut": "pear"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Then his elbow knocked over a champagne bottle, and it broke.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "stone",
        "stone": "tanzanite",
        "metal": "yellow",
        "label": "A broken bottle",
        "cut": "oval"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Perry kept reading the note and pretended not to notice.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "ring",
        "stone": "peridot",
        "metal": "yellow",
        "label": "Pretending",
        "cut": "cushion"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "They landed on a Los Angeles rooftop where friends and family waited.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "bracelet",
        "stone": "sapphire",
        "metal": "yellow",
        "label": "A rooftop"
      }
    },
